{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_title", "source_sha256": "0be6f3bfa2812c71ea59a024e8bc63ea54f4f53efef5f4f5fc150653a968ba11", "ja": "あの空に手が届くまで", "zh": "直到触及那片蓝天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_synopsis", "source_sha256": "210fc50a363b5dbd58c25062ef2068de222a4a5217eb624cc5c91e131dafb4f7", "ja": "次の公演のセンターを任され、気合い充分の\n紗代子。公演に向け、仲間と特訓を開始。\n限界を超えた練習内容に、全員ヘトヘトに\nなるが、紗代子達はやりきったことで\n大きな自信を手に入れる。", "zh": "纱代子获选为下次公演的Center而干劲十足，\n与伙伴们一起针对公演展开特训。\n超越极限的练习内容使得全员都筋疲力竭，\n却也为撑到最后的纱代子等人带来极大自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1000_p", "source_sha256": "05b92e1c6f3a0a940e0bd0146f0f8e0d85d0dc02d1dd94bc1971d08a769b5d25", "ja": "（いよいよ紗代子たちの特訓が始まることになった。\n特訓にふさわしい練習をするため、とかで……）", "zh": "（纱代子她们的特训终于要开始了。\n她们说为了进行称得上是特训的练习……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1001_p", "source_sha256": "db110f5d4f320c878a499078973a5ddf21dab36e8509fcf4bdba85a44494be2c", "ja": "（みんなで海にやってきた）", "zh": "（于是大家一起来到海边。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "bbf1e0816969986265881c4c8148a1ea76c0a04147304beb17302f6c7082dfac", "ja": "みんな、まずは歌の特訓だよ！\nあの夕日に向かって、走り込もう！", "zh": "各位，首先是唱歌的特训喔！\n朝向夕阳那方，一起奔跑吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "5a6aaaaf52a0ed284e2760f98245a59e3e6bc44afb25f4efe7dd3834902ce36a", "ja": "よーし、気合い充分！\nアイドルの特訓には最高のロケーションだよね！", "zh": "很好～我干劲十足！\n这里真是进行偶像特训的绝佳地点耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1004_p", "source_sha256": "af9c812077a51ca675cbe176fbe45e7ff0ca73c4c8712d9d3b670052a215ba94", "ja": "そうだな。アイドルの特訓とは何か、難しい所だが……\n無茶だけはしないようにな！", "zh": "是啊，虽然很难界定偶像特训究竟是什么……\n总之千万别太乱来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "f0d97d87a92d171be80aa22e81095db1e380f8195ff6eb2c3ea9ba82add97eee", "ja": "わかってるって！\nでもさ、どれくらい走ればいいんだ？", "zh": "我们知道啦！\n不过，是要跑多远啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "d2bb9aed43b289095611cbff86b766bb91dec8a936b3f318ef14d6ac423e7f00", "ja": "もちろん、力の限りだよ、昴ちゃん！", "zh": "当然是跑到用尽体力啊，小昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "f83650ae3495caad04ed7af5863cc7b5ce59452bc5184dc0e80cf47cd45e2302", "ja": "そっか……！　わかったぜ、紗代子！\nオレ、マジで、すっげー燃えてきた！", "zh": "是喔……我知道了，纱代子！\n我开始觉得好热血啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "b532df35c7524f282d3bc5e5601402acd43aca8589d100201dc1eb77d2b65f1a", "ja": "よし！　そうと決まったら、さっさと始めようぜ！\nぼやぼやしてると、日が沈んじまうからな。", "zh": "很好！既然都这么决定了，那就赶快开始吧！\n再这样慢吞吞的，太阳都要下山了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "d6baed5abdd6116015d6b48904fc3853b70fb65abbc0490704cda305605477ae", "ja": "紗代子さん、私も力の限り、ついていきますね。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "纱代子，我也会尽力跟上，直到不行为止。\n请多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "4136ca4f5d5f5667aaea363f2bdec1fed1673d92b16294550b9c0be244a8ba78", "ja": "うん、二人もよろしくね。\nそれじゃみんな、行こう！", "zh": "嗯，也请你们两位多多指教。\n那么各位，我们上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1014_null", "source_sha256": "29f711cba89046c8e3e73d6c7d1eaae547d052211c63c2e3cf126c11cbb4a335", "ja": "（ザッザッザッザッザッザ……）", "zh": "（踢跶踢跶踢跶……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "fdc7a10735e0a064bc17270dd00fb5b51caa378768665cae19238b8feda94130", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。ごめん、オレもうダメかも……！\n足が動かないよ、紗代子……！", "zh": "呼……呼……抱歉，我好像不行了……！\n脚动不了了，纱代子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "e151816a3f4897ba2ec9be3828586ffd74841903e8ebc5833f72e7e161f726fe", "ja": "しっかりしなよ！　昴なら、まだ行けるはずだよっ！\n一球入魂の野球魂はどこいったの！？", "zh": "再加把劲啊！昴应该还能再跑下去！\n你那一球入魂的棒球魂上哪去了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7af42073e70aee55f470dbec82ec72fa8248ece16bfc399a2ce21b18cefdc926", "ja": "（アイドル魂はなくさないでくれよ……）", "zh": "（我拜托你们不要迷失掉偶像魂了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "4103b65bf3edf5e5444991cbd016b9428440ef8e8cf9818da8e60a1dbd2f39b3", "ja": "昴ちゃんは、ここであきらめるの！？\n夕日はまだ、あんなに燃え上がってるのに……！", "zh": "小昴，你要就此放弃吗！？\n夕阳不是还那么火红吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "9c1a706da3640e03a9451d94e6afdaccfe3f1f383389aadf72e065d39f3011b4", "ja": "そ、そっか……。\nあの夕日は、まだ沈んでないんだっ。", "zh": "对、对耶……\n那道夕阳，还没有落下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "5faa764369e030d9b921139860b04efae7bea922697b8dc19c862e7e2bf777f3", "ja": "ごめん紗代子、オレが間違ってた！\nオレ、まだ走れるから！", "zh": "抱歉纱代子，我错了！\n我还能继续跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "642f1a8e2e915dd35a462fd8da99fba7473498e22ab22dc84c79f28645b1717c", "ja": "そうだよ昴！　そうこなくっちゃ！\n特訓は、まだ始まったばっかりだからね！", "zh": "没错，昴！这样才对嘛！\n特训才刚开始啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "ec37f04fa3e95276b1420f92a5e87e2d982edca0ac6f3cb2fea3f7d45a82c57d", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……でも、さすがに、\nひたすら走るってのは、大変だな……。", "zh": "呼、呼……不过，\n一直不断跑步，实在挺累人的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "ca5dae1f98abd7e6a2577785347b303e613d8c1661ec8af028ce2f63d1b28042", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……そ、そういえば……\nあの、紗代子さん。歌の練習のハズだったんじゃ……？", "zh": "呼……呼……话、话说回来……\n那个，纱代子。我们本来不是要做歌唱练习吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "850e485dd25bb2a43c4b8c832ce3d84fcdd268fcdb4167bb2f24b159daeca124", "ja": "まずは肺活量！", "zh": "首先要练肺活量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "850e485dd25bb2a43c4b8c832ce3d84fcdd268fcdb4167bb2f24b159daeca124", "ja": "まずは肺活量！", "zh": "首先要练肺活量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "850e485dd25bb2a43c4b8c832ce3d84fcdd268fcdb4167bb2f24b159daeca124", "ja": "まずは肺活量！", "zh": "首先要练肺活量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "fc72db96087d8accd887a0a3a19247cb33b415c3dc3adfb91ed7c5093a403d1b", "ja": "ひっ！　わ、わかりました～！", "zh": "呃！我、我知道了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1028_null", "source_sha256": "c0c892349b4af30929089444fdeda0cef86bf30fd194dc7972c7b4dca0e5fdbb", "ja": "（そして……）", "zh": "（然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "eb6ec2cb37e3cb26cf4276a45a8a3ee6bb58ab9e4397e8799b8ca0c98017e108", "ja": "はぁ……みんな、お疲れさま～！\nいったん、ここまでにしよっか！", "zh": "呼……大家辛苦了～！\n先到此为止吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "5ddf80ebdb6f58ef58428ce2d9d316373fc05b47ba4d58d2fbfa57e4b656fcf9", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\nな、なんだか……息が、血の味がします……！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……\n总、总觉得……呼吸有血的味道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "889f5b3c6dbb85a926d7117e7cdb236f590bc1a451f715fdce0ccca0d4163341", "ja": "がんばったなユリコ、はぁ、はぁ……。これも、\n日頃のレッスンのおかげ、か……はぁ、はぁ……。", "zh": "百合子很努力呢，呼、呼……\n这都多亏了平时的训练，是吧……呼、呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "de0edd366a4e2e708baa47159ab36c5d9124f6a2f28cbc76244213badd985aab", "ja": "二人ともお疲れさま！　タオル、ちゃんとみんなの分も\n持ってきてるから、汗をふくのに使ってね。", "zh": "你们两位都辛苦了！\n我有准备好每个人的毛巾，大家拿去擦汗吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "fcbe4bf0025248ab3de029e77f02d91910d71ced82da97464d2a82570591b019", "ja": "あ、あとレモンのはちみつ漬けも作ってきたから、\nよかったら食べてね。きっと元気になるよ！", "zh": "啊，我还做了蜂蜜腌柠檬过来，\n不嫌弃的话请用，吃了一定能打起精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "7a19ca112166e268e05525426bd6ecd737a68610e4fd0314af51a3dd0ebec9d8", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます♪\nさっそく、いただきますね！", "zh": "哇，谢谢你♪\n那我就不客气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "8a44f630890a3732123dd07aaed6bf41caf0c558d7380b855b9a1b95572a0e6d", "ja": "サンキュ、サヨ！\nさすが、気が利くよな～。", "zh": "谢啦，纱代！\n你真的很贴心耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "86cdd25e42b9e9fe14bc65f20f4a0fb5743a852f9b685ffebcf22de78f9e7f64", "ja": "私の特訓に付き合ってもらってるんだから。\nこれくらい当然だよ。", "zh": "你们都来陪我特训了，\n这点小事是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "93bb7ddcc45d39ea3d318c1d6d92bdae407fe122d6fae8bd940b217658fcc48c", "ja": "まだまだドリンクとか、いろいろ持ってきたから、\n遠慮しないで、どんどん栄養とってね！", "zh": "我还准备了很多东西过来，也有饮料之类的，\n你们不用客气，尽量补充营养吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1038_p", "source_sha256": "51bdcf2186947eb807e362c2da4ad949bfbdac8fd34e1393e0f680aef5c11b8d", "ja": "……みんな、お疲れさま。一時はどうなることかと\n思ったけど、なんとかやりきったみたいだな！", "zh": "……大家辛苦了。我本来还担心会怎么样，\n但总算是撑到最后了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "928331bbd24fbfe4613ee389aebd4dba914358efc7a0bcce3b53181099e425eb", "ja": "はい！　これなら本番の公演も、最後まで\n全力でやりとげられそうな気がしてきました！", "zh": "是啊！照着这个步调，我觉得正式公演时，\n我也能全力完成表演直到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "d2c66bbe471a61f14b1b2a5bed649294c87f1e0415e183a605b3c1f388be8426", "ja": "ん～っ、おいしい！　生き返ったよ～。\nレモンとはちみつって、やっぱり最強タッグだよね！", "zh": "嗯～好好吃！我复活了～\n柠檬跟蜂蜜果然是最强组合呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "8ae01c1168cdb7080e29480a9e28e7bc933aeacc46177af409916ef041f4946c", "ja": "サイコーにおいしかったぜ、紗代子♪　\nさて、休憩はこの辺にして、次は千本ノックな！", "zh": "超好吃的耶，纱代子♪\n好了，休息也该告一段落了，接下来是千次击球练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "234f228098bcbf2db0bfc7019d217e64d96a0cc8f73a7cddd72419d0b8666947", "ja": "ふふっ、ノックじゃないよ、昴ちゃん。\n次はダンスの練習だから。千本ダッシュだよ！", "zh": "呵呵，不是击球啦，小昴。\n接下来是舞蹈练习，所以是千次短跑喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1043_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "6204ed4507ad3b3a21c0ddc2d6516e80f1970c20dba8525174ae16ac8dddbaf5", "ja": "おっと、そうだった。\nへへ、ゴメンゴメン！", "zh": "对耶，我都忘了。\n嘿嘿，抱歉抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1045_047sub", "source_sha256": "7b299407ca8e9e1270745a24e4eed79911842b4612ed710388b479e701304e79", "ja": "元気も回復したし、体も温まりまくってるし。\n今度こそ、オレの底力をみせてやるぜ！", "zh": "我不只恢复活力，身体也暖到不行。\n这次我一定要让你们见识到我的真本领！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "14095504ffed0b10c2221fceb99655cfd784602733761c01a55d4997cbc3738e", "ja": "おっ、昴やる気だね？\nだったら、アタシもフルパワーでいくよ！", "zh": "哦，昴很有干劲呢。\n既然如此，我也要使出全力上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "c69541470313be7426fc8b26f14d4469ac0e9b2c20543b819e4b3196c08a69be", "ja": "フフッ、次のステージの始まりだな。\nユリコ、いけるか？", "zh": "呵呵，看来下一阶段要开始了呢。\n百合子，你行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa3a222adc92975334b58855b6a01067112f48973de9e8f9f5e84c6d1e56d947", "ja": "追い詰められて、もうだめだと思った時にこそ、\n真の力が覚醒する……。そういうものだと思います！", "zh": "当人被逼上绝境，感到无力再起之际，\n真正的力量才会觉醒……我是这么认为的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1049_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1050_027say", "source_sha256": "bca0a58d0c9102932bddbaaab4045ee8b04291c07f5fe4b6aa8ea9a2bd054d30", "ja": "ジュリア、百合子……のり子さんも、昴ちゃんも。\nみんな、ありがとう！", "zh": "茱莉亚、百合子……还有法子跟小昴。\n各位，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1051_027say", "source_sha256": "d0ec66605ebe448d815fbc6356e7f89d777056f52dc47c7122e364bac4eaa500", "ja": "最後まで、みんな一緒に走り抜けようね！\nまずは1本目！　よーい、どん！", "zh": "让我们大家一起冲刺到最后吧！\n首先是第1次！预备～跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1052_null", "source_sha256": "887c23c0bb6854c4f88b972685e373ffe4be2233ed21cb69fd7a1432335ef01f", "ja": "（ダダダダッ！　ダダダダッ！　ダダダダッ！\nダダダダッ！　ダダダダッ！　ダダダダ……ッ！）", "zh": "（跶跶跶跶！跶跶跶跶！跶跶跶跶！\n跶跶跶跶！跶跶跶跶！跶跶跶跶……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1053_043nor", "source_sha256": "b9f67ba0940e5761201a510e0ceebab5f29ed15e7cfcd6384c87174790098807", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……\nさ、352……本目……。", "zh": "呼……呼……\n第、第352……次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1054_043nor", "source_sha256": "4576024f1d41db273d86f7985fd32d2c9ca7e7a51f265af4c7506b27b3729f2d", "ja": "だ、ダメだ……。\nごめん、みんな。アタシを置いて、先に行って……。", "zh": "我、我不行了……\n抱歉，大家。不用管我，你们先走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1055_047sub", "source_sha256": "bc972f53149b6e2212c4d071f7d62797eb622abdb049934a5b62951462987a5a", "ja": "なに言ってるんだよ、のり子！\nあの夕日に笑われちゃうぜ！", "zh": "你在说什么啊，法子！\n你会被那道夕阳嘲笑喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1056_047sub", "source_sha256": "686a3d0c45a2b8326689c7d4304e1338460801cccc5ede121d8756f6513d6048", "ja": "ほら、行こうよ。オレたちと一緒に、\n紗代子のステージに立つんだろ！？", "zh": "来，走吧。你不是要和我们一起，\n站上纱代子的舞台吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1057_027say", "source_sha256": "2a1967a190ad53d006fafc31b22fcca4fc798443255fc893ff633207afa39f88", "ja": "そうですよ、のり子さん。この壁を乗り越えた先に、\n新しい自分が待っているはずです！", "zh": "就是说啊，法子。\n跨越这道高墙后，会有崭新的自己等着你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1058_043nor", "source_sha256": "f838ede3b1911d987b03aab3d3f8883d7761392117ab7a2cb27e7709187a0844", "ja": "昴、紗代子……。フフ、そうだよね。\nアタシ、なに弱気になってたんだろう。", "zh": "昴、纱代子……呵呵，你们说得对。\n我怎能这么软弱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1059_043nor", "source_sha256": "c11fc5db9440d1243b927dd85a26e299489e5f2b53fad53b4f79dcc118f17d43", "ja": "リングに上がる前に、あきらめるプロレスラーなんか\nいないよね。アタシ、まだやれるよ！", "zh": "没有摔角选手会在站上擂台前就放弃。\n我还能继续努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1060_050jul", "source_sha256": "1ac277100f33dfeb14b337ab4f67a4013c879c63bef9362e16dc6dc91712ff46", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……、とはいえ、やっと半分、か……。\nさすがに、足の感覚がなくなって来たな……", "zh": "呼、呼……话虽如此，是不是，终于跑完一半了……\n我的脚要没知觉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1061_026yur", "source_sha256": "d84b7ee71b201dc90cdce494bd08f118d10869adfcd93c8802896c1d0984815d", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……そ、そういえば、あの……、\n紗代子さん、これ……ダンスの練習、ですか？", "zh": "呼……呼……这、这么说来，那个……\n纱代子，这算……舞蹈练习……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1062_027say", "source_sha256": "15f862ed4d9dcdf7f43c9e24083eab5a60c07db150f4499aff7e3d0eba9bd693", "ja": "まずは脚力！", "zh": "首先要练脚力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1063_043nor", "source_sha256": "15f862ed4d9dcdf7f43c9e24083eab5a60c07db150f4499aff7e3d0eba9bd693", "ja": "まずは脚力！", "zh": "首先要练脚力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1064_047sub", "source_sha256": "15f862ed4d9dcdf7f43c9e24083eab5a60c07db150f4499aff7e3d0eba9bd693", "ja": "まずは脚力！", "zh": "首先要练脚力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1065_026yur", "source_sha256": "fc72db96087d8accd887a0a3a19247cb33b415c3dc3adfb91ed7c5093a403d1b", "ja": "ひっ！　わ、わかりました～！", "zh": "呃！我、我知道了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1066_null", "source_sha256": "c0c892349b4af30929089444fdeda0cef86bf30fd194dc7972c7b4dca0e5fdbb", "ja": "（そして……）", "zh": "（然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1067_027say", "source_sha256": "147f395030187b4b4adff02a540ad79ac7253a056dcfd582ee221f59c19fff0e", "ja": "ラスト～っ……1000本目……っ、\nよ～い……ど～ん……っ。", "zh": "最后……第1000次……\n预～备……跑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1068_null", "source_sha256": "1e3e57bf355cae04ca137d4db669732a08a9bb9e1aca9b6e0761404d9daf50b4", "ja": "（ズズッ……ズズズッ……ズズッ……ズ……）", "zh": "（踢跶……踢踢跶跶……踢跶……跶……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1070_027say", "source_sha256": "ed69f126e4f2ebe2f60e1b02e4a0cd7b448f0fb03e4cb2af5340fef7cfe187e4", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\n{$P$}、もう1歩も動けません……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼、呼……\n{$P$}，我已经一步也不能动了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1071_p", "source_sha256": "cca3e969a6115f04838e607a57fcc2fee4cc14c2b32c35df5f35b1a0a87a4c70", "ja": "そうだろうな……。\nここまで出来るなんて、俺もすごく驚いてるよ……。", "zh": "我想也是……\n你们居然能练到这个地步，我也非常讶异……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1072_043nor", "source_sha256": "a84c918528d7bb83b61ec12b78374d580f9a545024e44a916e8b7d7496fedc62", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……もう、本当に空っぽ……。\n今倒れたらアタシ、3カウント絶対取られちゃう……。", "zh": "呼、呼……我真的已经没力了……\n要是我现在倒下，绝对会被裁判数三声判输……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1073_047sub", "source_sha256": "e9ac90eb244dace55f9a96c1a2bc71460dc5992af384630a7bd0a5f34811b533", "ja": "オレも、もう、絶対ムリ……延長30回までいった\n試合でも、もっと全然、マシだった気がする……！", "zh": "我也真的，再也，跑不动了……\n就算打到第30局延长赛，搞不好都比这个还要轻松……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1074_050jul", "source_sha256": "2dd22f76800a6359304ace7c9a58a323c4687e6212a9a08c4ff7f0995c444fd3", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nでも、たまにはこういうのも、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "呼、呼……\n不过，偶尔这样练习，还算不赖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1075_026yur", "source_sha256": "7570a1b7722d5644ccef2d804b11175c8eedc89ed84b242ec015674218925f7f", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……、そう、ですね。\n私、ここまでやり切ったの……初めてで……。", "zh": "呼、呼……就是，说啊。\n我还是第一次……这么贯彻始终……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1076_026yur", "source_sha256": "d382d9851237bf62d1619cf47e82ebf23107d3b519d9b0affe834361c1fdda9b", "ja": "限界なんて、とっくに超えてて……最後はもう、\n指先しか動いてなかった気もしますけど……でも……。", "zh": "我早就已经超越极限了……快结束时，\n我觉得根本只剩指头有在动……不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1077_026yur", "source_sha256": "960c41955346dcb98fbbc2ba07d97b1ad0ee367533162d8580f11eb7de6c2a45", "ja": "私でも、こんなに……がんばれたっていう、自信じゃ\nないんですけど……貴重な経験が、できました……！", "zh": "原来我也能……如此努力，虽然不会因此就多有自信……\n但我获得了很宝贵的经验……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1078_050jul", "source_sha256": "64e28a11b31f9a10e889ed9d6373c88d175b7cbb03cd18a80dc26419f454d72b", "ja": "ああ……少なくとも、ウチらは、\nここまで、やれるってことだ。ははっ！", "zh": "是啊……这至少代表了，\n我们有能耐做到这个地步。哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1079_026yur", "source_sha256": "27287ac85e60452daddbb18b9409341d243d564e6acde449d5c543c8dca341be", "ja": "あ……。もしかして、紗代子さんは……\nこの特訓で、そういうことを、教えるつもりで……？", "zh": "啊……莫非纱代子……\n是想借由这次特训，教导我们这些……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1080_027say", "source_sha256": "a0b0b66053d54a18349bdd61f55fcb62024161a30c9cf3aaa2aab113454d8faa", "ja": "ううん、そんなこと、ちっとも……。\n私はただ、やり残したくなかっただけで……。", "zh": "不，我完全没想那么多……\n我只是不想留下遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1081_027say", "source_sha256": "9de789a17c552b72c4e4b55ba9e028f9866d755b64e84ac8cb52dd8a7476410e", "ja": "でも……、この特訓にゴーサインを出してくれたって\nことは、もしかして{$P$}は……？", "zh": "不过……既然会同意我们做这次特训，\n该不会{$P$}早就预料到……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1082_p", "source_sha256": "2ab8668e8ae91b2b3aefef8f2a0467ded9c1a7f62b37d036a1e8ce2e13d57d77", "ja": "いや、そもそも、ここまでやるとは思ってなかったよ。\nただ、そうだな……。", "zh": "没啦，我根本没想到你们会做到这个地步。\n不过嘛，真要说起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_1083", "source_sha256": "2221f6c73659e71e62808a8c46fbb00f08f26096b42e2e92a3acd9aa7decc9b5", "ja": "やり切ってほしかった", "zh": "我很希望你们坚持到底", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2000_p", "source_sha256": "dbff0b3cc5e9c9a9a2015b4518089972cddab83c6f0f21daaf9be0b58d051bdc", "ja": "やり切ってほしかったのは確かかな。前だけを見つめる\n紗代子にも、その紗代子を応援してるみんなにも。", "zh": "我确实很希望你们能坚持到底，\n不管是勇往直前的纱代子，还是支持着纱代子的大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2001_p", "source_sha256": "20d06f9ea596805cdb92d007bb56b6d10580447cf7178e1ab19debe77b84b64a", "ja": "そして見事にやり切ってくれた。\n本当にみんな、たいしたもんだ！", "zh": "而你们确实达成了。\n大家真的都很了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2002_027say", "source_sha256": "9086487f382636f8b7ea43a2653f39cf6093eb6605bcbdfb87478a7cd09a0551", "ja": "{$P$}……。ありがとうございます。\n私、うれしいです。……その、期待してもらえて！", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢你。\n我听了好开心……谢谢你对我们有所期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2003_027say", "source_sha256": "5113378f19a52b2249388a40807d18d4f1774ba6818eeac4606da4418be27c31", "ja": "私、公演でも限界まで……ううん、限界を超えて、\n{$P$}の期待に応えてみせますね！", "zh": "我在公演时也会挑战极限……不，是超越极限，\n来回应{$P$}的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2004_043nor", "source_sha256": "f7babe691bf8e77ec68703e0e3d5ae04c99b30f04c45b37ed1690c87d2004a3f", "ja": "うん、そもそも限界を知らないと、\nそれを超えることなんてできないもんね！", "zh": "嗯，毕竟要是不知道极限在哪里，\n就没办法超越了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2005_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff2d9aa73029cb7a184aabb1de9c8818d6a31c1513bc3ddbfe8e157a2eb6c492", "ja": "けどオレたち、もうわかっちゃったもんな！\nこの先、怖いもんなんてなんにもないぜ！", "zh": "但我们已经认清极限了！\n这样之后就没什么好怕的了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2006_050jul", "source_sha256": "f3416c213ed8210b6464d9bec3fd876a025fc19f5336db6c29b98b2845d6fec0", "ja": "限界なんて吹っ飛ばして、駆け抜けるとするか。\nいけるとこまで、どこまでもな！", "zh": "让我们突破极限，冲刺到底吧。\n不管极限在哪里，能冲到哪就冲到哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2007_026yur", "source_sha256": "ad58a040140c8b101ddf2651980e29e480f2ea2a0ce29e7e0496a6ec1c41edf3", "ja": "追い込まれて覚醒したのは、きっと……\n私たちの心ですね！", "zh": "因为被逼到极限而觉醒的，\n一定是……我们的心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2008_027say", "source_sha256": "9fb1763c41abc3d320eb5eb768991c3752105e7e38fb373b3ac7972563697c50", "ja": "ありがとう、のり子さん、昴ちゃん。\nジュリアも百合子も、{$P$}も！", "zh": "法子、小昴，谢谢你们。\n还有茱莉亚和百合子，{$P$}也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2009_027say", "source_sha256": "08fa1d4f2ce0edb6253ecc151cbd74edb7bf7e1bc0b1e2f9c48d857cd644fad2", "ja": "今度の公演、最高のステージにできると思います！\n歌もダンスも、まだまだこれからですけど……。", "zh": "我想在这次公演，一定能展现最棒的表演！\n虽然唱歌和跳舞都是接下来才要开始练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2010_027say", "source_sha256": "dfcf67cc3738b0159599dd76475bb8f2f5ed83fae69d3d1b9b7a6184e0b75705", "ja": "でも、絶対にできます。自信があるんです。\n最後まで、絶対にやり抜けるって！", "zh": "不过，我们绝对办得到，我有自信。\n我们一定能努力坚持到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2011_p", "source_sha256": "74640072cfef5640ad744e6fd900aaf7559c9269fcc5d45c230442e2108c70a5", "ja": "（言い切った紗代子の瞳は、力強い光を湛えている。\nその光は、もしかしたら……）", "zh": "（如此断言的纱代子眼中，散发着坚定的光辉。\n那道光，说不定……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_021_2012_p", "source_sha256": "1b30cfb7e60178e722871d9c608342f3cb967a75af1ad1492c8721fdec112b56", "ja": "（紗代子が追い求める、アイドルとしての輝き。\nその光が、映り込んでいるだけかもな！）", "zh": "（说不定纯粹是纱代子所追求的偶像光辉，\n正好映入她的眼中吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
